# OrbitFabio — agent quick reference

- **Build / run iOS:** See repo root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) (install, `xcodebuild`, `expo run:ios`, Xcode workspace path).
- **Where things run:** [docs/ENVIRONMENT.md](../../docs/ENVIRONMENT.md) and prod stack [docs/PROD_NORTHSTAR_STACK.md](../../docs/PROD_NORTHSTAR_STACK.md).
- **Northstar SSH / Docker:** Read [docs/NORTHSTAR_SAFE_CHANGES.md](../../docs/NORTHSTAR_SAFE_CHANGES.md) before prune, teardown, or touching `192.168.1.116` containers.
- **Xcode:** Always **`apps/mobile/ios/OrbitFabio.xcworkspace`**, not the `.xcodeproj`.
- **After `git clone`:** `cd apps/mobile && npm install && cd ios && pod install`.
